   "id": "nmj",
   "title": "The neuromuscular junction",
   "kind": "Simulation",
   "sub": "Acetylcholine release, receptors and acetylcholinesterase at a cholinergic synapse, the same chemistry that passes every signal from motor neurone to muscle fibre; summation, blockers and toxins.",
   "note": "SciGradify Biology's simulation of a cholinergic synapse: a small kinetic model with illustrative values; the sequence of events is accurate.",
   "tasks": null,
   "lessons": [
    "u01-17",
